      "value": "Yes! RIGHT!\n\nNeed add Post proccessing active in world will work fixed photo anti aliasing, \n\n      IF Don't Add Post proccesing active in world WILL NOT WORK is broken main camera on Vrchat 2022 side..\n\n FIX PLEASE!",
